# Evidence bytes are constitutional inputs.
#
# Gate evidence is cited by hash. If Git ever normalised a line ending on the
# way into or out of the index, the cited hash would stop matching the file and
# the citation would read as tampering rather than as a config change. Marking
# the tree -text takes that possibility off the table regardless of what
# core.autocrlf or core.eol are set to on any future machine.
evidence/** -text
